import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Us | Helix Equine Vets"
  description="Learn more about Helix Equine Vets and Max Ling"
>

<section class ="prose-container">
<h1>About Us</h1>
<p>Helix Equine is an independent, ambulatory equine veterinary practice founded by Max Ling BVMS CertAVP PGCertVPS MRCVS, serving Northumberland and parts of Tyne and Wear.</p>
</section>

<section class ="prose-navy-wrapper">
  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2>Meet Max</h2>
    <p>I've spent more than ten years working as an equine vet across Northumberland and Tyne and Wear, caring for thousands of horses — from racehorses and competition horses to family ponies and donkeys. But what's meant the most over those years hasn't just been the clinical work; it's the relationships built with the people behind the horses — owners, trainers, riders and grooms who put enormous trust in their vet.</p>
    <p>After graduating from the University of Glasgow, I stayed on as an intern while the Weipers Centre awaited new staff. From there I moved to a twelve-month internship at Fethard Equine Hospital in Tipperary, Ireland — a busy, predominantly racing referral hospital before returning to Northumberland.</p>
    <p>Since then I've spent the last ten years working across two practices in Northumberland, building on the foundations laid in Ireland and coming to understand what reliable, practical veterinary care really means for horses and owners in this region. I am a Senior Vet at Newcastle Racecourse, attending race meets regularly throughout the year, a FEI Permitted Treating Veterinarian, and I hold a Certificate in Advanced Veterinary Practice (CertAVP).</p>
  </div>
</section>



</BaseLayout>